<title>USA: Rosemount, Minn. won by Cronin.</title>
<headline>Rosemount, Minn. won by Cronin.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cronin &amp; Co., Inc., said it won $2.8 million of Rosemount, Minn., general obligation improvement bonds, Series 1997 A, with a true interest cost of 4.78 percent.</p>
</text>
